article.common-document
  header.header
    h2.title BBJ2K dataset
  .contents
    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Summary
      p.body
        | BBJ2K contains allele and genotype frequencies derived from whole-genome sequencing (WGS) data
        | for 1,964 participants in
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://biobankjp.org/english/index.html') BioBank Japan
        | . TogoVar provides the frequencies on GRCh38.
      ul.unordered-list
        li Sample size: 1,964
        li Reference genome: GRCh38
        li Number of variants in TogoVar: 21,596,248
        li
          | Source data:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000495') JGAD000495
        li
          | Processed data:
          |
          a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/dataset/JGAD000868') JGAD000868

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Data processing
      p.body
        | The NBDC Human Database processed WGS data from 1,964 BioBank Japan participants and released a GRCh38
        | imputation reference panel (GRCh38.BBJ2K.tar.gz) on August 8, 2024. The source dataset is JGAD000495,
        | and the processed dataset is JGAD000868.
      p.body
        | See the NBDC Human Database page for
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/processed-data-imputation') processed imputation reference data
        | for the source dataset and processing date.

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Relationship to JGA-WGS
      p.body
        | JGAD000868 is also included in TogoVar as a dataset-specific frequency under JGA-WGS.

    section.section
      h3.sectiontitle Terms of use
      p.body
        | Aggregated frequencies in TogoVar are publicly viewable. To use the source data or controlled-access
        | processed data, specify JGAD000495 and JGAD000868 when applying through
        |
        a.hyper-text.-external(target='_blank', href='https://humandbs.dbcls.jp/en/data-use') Data Use
        | .
